<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87617" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκαθ-ίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>appoint beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρχειν αὐτὸν τῶν σωματοφυλάκων . .
					προκαταστήσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					58.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλακας προκαθιστάμενοι</span>
			<i>causing</i> them <i>to be posted in front,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				6.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>prepare</i> or <i>arrange before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκαταστήσασθαι τὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					5.2
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>establish before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκαταστήσασθαι ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					8.379
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> Lond.<i><span class="en">
				38.55
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.120
			</span></i> H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2 and pf.
			
				Act.
			, intr., <i>to be set before,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλακῆς μὴ προκαθεστηκυίας</span> no
			guard <i>having been set,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be established before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				11.41
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
